    "title_en": "Optimal Trace Distance Estimation",
    "abstract_en": "We present a trace distance estimator with optimal sample complexity. Specifically, the trace distance between two unknown $d$-dimensional quantum states can be estimated to within additive error $\\varepsilon$ using \n\\[ Θ\\left(\\frac{d^2}{\\varepsilon^2\\log^2(d)\\max\\left\\{1,\\varepsilon^2\\log^2(d)\\right\\}}\\right) \\]\n samples of each quantum state. This matches the lower bound of Wang (2026). The estimator combines tomography and polynomial approximation, with variance bounds from quantum Fourier analysis.",
